{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "东西都齐了，幸好帮了那位摊主还有那个工作人员。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 1,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "嘿咻。灭火器我放到这里了。我们要这些东西干什么啊？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 2,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "刚才我在周边遇到了一位本地木偶匠人，他用来制作木偶的丝线和我之前在飞机上看到的非常类似。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "这种丝线材质类似蛛丝，遇热会融化，遇冷会脆化。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "对了，那些人身体里被植入了丝线！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "是的，我们不能在飞机里放火，但却可以在不威胁飞机安全的情况下降温。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "花灯摊位有纸制品且靠近热源，属于易引发火灾的摊位类型。所以摊位里配备了不少二氧化碳灭火器。这种灭火器可以在飞机内小范围使用，能够快速降温。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 7,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "啊！只要我们拿这个喷飞机上被控制的人——",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "是的，我推测应该可以令他们暂时失去行动能力！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "哈哈！你真是太厉害了！师父果然是对的！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
